1a:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"Back to Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Google Ads Leaks · Clicks Without Conversions"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Fix Google Ads Landing Pages to Transform Clicks Into Sales"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If Google Ads is producing clicks but no sales, the campaign may be doing exactly what it should: creating arrival. The chain breaks when the landing page does not continue the conversation the ad started. Raising budget or adjusting bidding strategy does not fix what happens after the click."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-google-ads-clicks-no-sales&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"data-editorial":"answer-first","className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-