 proof element before the CTA"]}]]}]]}]
2d:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"Why does Google Ads produce clicks but no conversions?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Common hypotheses include: (1) the landing page headline does not match the search intent or ad promise; (2) no proof is visible before the CTA; and (3) the page loads slowly on mobile. Healthy ad click-through with high post-click bounce is a reason to investigate message match and page experience, but it does not by itself prove which component caused the outcome."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"How do I know if my Google Ads problem is the ad or the landing page?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Check CTR, conversion tracking, bounce rate by source, device, query, and landing-page variant together. Thresholds such as 3-5% CTR or 2% conversion rate are comparison points, not causal diagnoses. Healthy CTR with weak post-click behaviour prioritises a page-side hypothesis; it does not exclude ad targeting, offer fit, attribution, or traffic quality."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"What is message match in Google Ads?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Message match means the landing page headline uses the same noun phrase and intent as the ad and keyword that brought the visitor there. If a visitor clicks an ad for \"landing page audit tool\" and the page headline reads \"Welcome to Nebula,\" the match is broken. The visitor cannot confirm they are in the right place and leaves. The fix is to use the specific search intent from your highest-traffic keywords in your headline - not your brand name or a clever tagline."}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"Does sending Google Ads traffic to a homepage hurt conversion?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"It can when the homepage presents several audiences, offers, and conversion paths instead of continuing the ad’s specific promise. Compare homepage and dedicated-page performance for the same intent and traffic conditions before attributing the difference to page type."}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"border-b border-border pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"How do I fix a high bounce rate from Google Ads?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Test in this order: (1) compare the headline with the ad keyword and promise; (2) check mobile load time with Google PageSpeed Insights and use LCP under 2.5 seconds as a performance target; (3) inspect whether relevant proof appears before the CTA; and (4) test one clearly labelled CTA. Change one variable at a time and compare it with the current baseline before attributing an outcome."}]]}]]}]]}]
2e:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-accent/40 bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Find the break in the chain"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The free Nebula audit identifies likely page-side leaks. The $97 One-Leak Repair Sprint delivers a tailored kit for one high-confidence page-level finding. You or your developer implements it, and the 30-day re-audit verifies the page condition. It does not promise conversion lift."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-4","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre&utm_medium=organic-content","className":"inline-flex rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-bg hover:opacity-85 hover:bg-accent transition-colors","children":"Run the free audit"}],["$","$L21",null,{"href":"/pricing","className":"inline-flex rounded border border-accent px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-accent hover:bg-accent-dim transition-colors","children":"See the One-Leak Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}]
2f:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Related leak checks"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-1","children":[["$","$L21","/learning-centre/landing-page-not-converting",{"href":"/learning-centre/landing-page-not-converting","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Landing Page Not Converting? Diagnose These 5 Leaks First"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/high-cpc-low-conversion",{"href":"/learning-centre/high-cpc-low-conversion","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"High CPC, Low Conversion: Which Layer Is Broken"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/before-you-raise-ad-budget",{"href":"/learning-centre/before-you-raise-ad-budget","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Before You Raise Ad Budget: Fix The Leaks First"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/message-match-checklist",{"href":"/learning-centre/message-match-checklist","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Message Match Checklist For Paid Traffic"}],["$","$L21","/learning-centre/traffic-but-no-form-fills",{"href":"/learning-centre/traffic-but-no-form-fills","className":"block border-b border-border py-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors last:border-0 hover:text-accent","children":"Traffic But No Form Fills: The Form Is Usually Not The First Leak"}]]}]]}]
32:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-fg","children":"CTA asks for too much too soon"}]
33:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If the first action available requires significant commitment - booking a call, entering payment details, or filling out a long form - on a page the visitor has never seen before, the mismatch between trust level and ask size creates friction that blocks the conversion. For cold search traffic, the CTA should match the temperature of the relationship: a low-commitment first step (free audit, free trial, download) is appropriate before a high-commitment ask."}]
